  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PDWSA DANIDA SP 2.0 &#x2013; Flex Funds 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Palestinian Developmental WomenStudies Association (PDWSA), tentatively starting on 15 October 2025. The intervention seeks to addressthe urgent multi-sectoral needs of the most affected and economically vulnerable families whose access toincome, markets, and basic services has been severely disrupted due to the ongoing humanitarian crisis.This intervention is expected to enhance the resilience and dignity of targeted families by enabling them tomeet their essential and diverse needs while contributing to improved well-being and reduced protectionrisks &#x2014; particularly among women, children, and persons with disabilities</narrative>
  </description>
